   "body": "*Issue #, if available:*\r\n\r\nNone\r\n\r\n*Description of changes:*\r\n\r\nHere are the Open Data Registry specs for AllenAI datasets (those listed at https://allenai.org/data) which have a license.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBy submitting this pull request, I confirm that you can use, modify, copy, and redistribute this contribution, under the terms of your choice.",
   "author_comments": [
    "Hmm, I see there's a failure with\r\n\r\n```\r\n - Cannot find required key 'Resources'. Path: ''.: Path: '/'>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI omitted this per @chueatwork's email conversation, where she explained that was an optional field.\r\n\r\nBut if this is required, then it'll always point to the our S3 bucket (e.g., https://ai2-public-datasets.s3.amazonaws.com/conversational-dialog-traces/naacl2015_resources.zip). I'll update the files."
   ]
  },
